  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your space with this personalized Comforter Set from Jeminise, perfect for baseball enthusiasts. Customize it to make it uniquely yours or create a thoughtful gift for a loved one who lives and breathes baseball.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Designed for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating determination and passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features an environmental protection finishing process that helps fabric hold dye and prevent fading, ensuring lasting vibrancy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfortable Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric for a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Whole-Piece Microfiber Filling:</strong> Equipped with whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching to prevent clumping or shifting, providing consistent comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for quick drying and fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Includes options for custom names, allowing for a personalized touch to your bedding.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
